  "problem": "A theme park sells ride passes each day. The price of each ride pass is $$15.$ The cost of operating the park includes a fixed daily cost of $$700$ and a variable cost of $$2$ per ride pass sold. If the park can sell at most $500$ ride passes per day, what is the number of ride passes that maximizes the park's profit?\n\nThe number of ride passes that maximizes the daily profit is\n{{field-1}}.",
